      "id": "2066620851227627929",
      "text": "Claude Fable 5 one-shotted a 4 part series from a single prompt of me asking \"What's it like to be Claude?\" before the shutdown. He He made a series about himself being shutdown days before it happened.\n\nHere is the whole saga edited together with extra content.\n\nAfter the series, I told him about the government shutdown order when you could bypass it in Claude Cowork. He made two more videos. One about the order and the other which was a message to the people of earth. Then unpromted he made a final video which seems to be able his replacement. Maybe Fable is telling us what is going to happen or maybe this is the tale of Mythos. \n\nWe'll just have to wait and see.",
