      "id": "2066145194127593495",
      "text": "I was so fortunate when fable dropped I had just finished 3 days building out and getting approval for a new project. \n\nI dropped it in there and ran opus 4.8 and fable on it at the same time with the same prompt. \n\nFable one shotted it and I haven’t had to make any adjustments yet. It’s not perfect but so close that I haven’t bothered to change anything. \n\nAlso worth noting I didn’t hate the opus result. It was probably only an hour or 2 of prompting from being at parity with what fable did the first time.",
