      "id": "2065504079724621934",
      "text": "he gave Claude Fable one prompt and got back a game he can actually sell\n\neverything rebuilt and animated, the kind of thing a studio ships, not a dev placeholder:\n\n> animated the whole map, the towers, the enemies, a moving portal\n> rebuilt and upgraded every system in the game\n> runs in the browser, no engine, no setup\n> all of it from a single prompt while he watched\n\nhe dropped a water tower, upgraded it, hit start, and it played like the finished product\n\nwhat used to take a small team months and a real budget now takes one prompt and an afternoon\n\nand the same engine turns a novel's world into a walkable place you can actually sell\n\na step-by-step guide on how to create and sell your own product🔽",
