    {
      "id": "2065446448984977673",
      "text": "Claude Fable 5 one-shotted this full game world in Three.js. \n\nThe part worth paying attention to: when the browser started lagging, it didn't wait for a human to notice. It screenshotted the output, checked frame rates, diagnosed the performance hit, and fixed itself recursively. \n\nThat's an AI closing the feedback loop on its own work in real time. \nSelf-correcting output, shipped in one shot. That's the bar now.\n\nhttps://t.co/a0z4SJ1mvI",
      "author": {
        "id": "16922531",
        "name": "Aditya ⚡Rao",
        "screenName": "adityarao310",
        "profileImageUrl": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1999853059006959619/pIOLO0EU_normal.jpg",
        "verified": true
      },
      "metrics": {
