      "createdAtISO": "2026-06-12T14:49:42+00:00",
      "media": [],
      "urls": [],
      "isRetweet": false,
      "retweetedBy": null,
      "lang": "en",
      "score": null,
      "quotedTweet": {
        "id": "2065277854615572901",
        "text": "Fable 5 is genuinely cracked at indie games…\n\nFun fact, a lot of people didn’t believe me because it looks too good to be Claude Fable\n\nHowever it lobotomized the original game because my browser was lagging initially, so it made slightly smaller rooms and dimmed the dynamic lighting. This is the full un-lobotomized version 💀",
        "author": {
